## Where to start?

Carolyn knew social media mattered for her business. She also had a full plate of clients and no idea what to post. That is where we came in.

## Build a habit

We built a social strategy that speaks straight to her audience and makes her credibility obvious, then anchored it with a few high-quality videos. The plan made landing new clients easier and posting a habit.

## Running out of room

Carolyn is growing so fast that she is outgrowing her garage Pilates studio. Once she finds a space to call home, we get to grow the next chapter with her.
